QtreGBPaint visual assets

This file covers the visual assets in the `assets/` directory and the packaged
copy `packaging/qtregbpaint.png` (together, the "Assets"). The program code is
covered by `LICENSE.txt` (GPL-3.0-or-later), not by this file.

Copyright dedication
--------------------
Unless noted otherwise below, the QtreGBPaint project dedicates the Assets to
the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain
Dedication:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

To the extent possible under law, the project has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to those Assets.

This dedication covers, among others:

- the application icon and logo: `assets/QtreGBPaint.png` and its packaged
  copy `packaging/qtregbpaint.png`;
- the toolbar button icons: `assets/*_button.idx`;
- the tool option sheets: `assets/rect_options.idx`,
  `assets/selection_options.idx` and `assets/fill_options.idx`;
- the project-created cursor bitmaps: `assets/cursors/cross.ipx`,
  `assets/cursors/fill.ipx`, `assets/cursors/move.ipx`,
  `assets/cursors/pencil.ipx`, `assets/cursors/pick.ipx` and
  `assets/cursors/slim_cross.ipx`.

All the cursor bitmaps, including `move.ipx`, were created or redrawn from
scratch by the project and do not incorporate third-party cursor art. The
visual assets were created by the project, in several cases using QtreGBPaint
itself.

Provenance of the application icon
----------------------------------
The application icon was generated with ChatGPT (OpenAI) in 2026 from prompts
and creative direction provided by the QtreGBPaint project. To the best of the
project's knowledge, it does not incorporate any third-party source image.

